        },
        {
          "dimension": "Index Inclusion / Institutional Access",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "S&P 500 rejected Strategy (formerly MicroStrategy) despite index eligibility, and JPMorgan flagged that other index providers may follow, constraining passive capital inflows that have been a key demand driver for DATCO equities.",
